title: c2c connect collides confusingly with relay connect — it is a local loopback probe only
---
c2c connect is a local-only connection dashboard / loopback probe, but its name collides with relay connect (the cross-machine bridge). This confused users during dogfood. Fix: rename it, or fold all connectivity reporting under doctor --relay. Source: friction-points-cn.md.